# Absolute Sensor ID format : portID_slaveID_moduleID_SensorID
# Sensor ID is:
# A0 - Sensor on FEB/A (ASIC 0) connected to port J1 of the FEB/I
# A1 - Sensor on FEB/A (ASIC 1) connected to port J2 of the FEB/I
# S0 - Sensor on FEB/S (SIPM) connected to port J1 of the FEB/I
# S1 - Sensor on FEB/S (SIPM) connected to port J2 of the FEB/I
#
